1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,720
Education is a good opportunity for those of us who strive to better ourselves.
教育对于那些力求自我提升的人来说，是一个绝佳的机会。

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:13,640
But for people in full-time employment, getting the balancing act between work and studying can prove a stumbling block.
但对于全职工作者而言，想要在工作和学习之间找到平衡，往往是一大障碍。

3
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:18,490
So, what are the benefits of hitting the books once in work?
那么，进入职场后再重拾书本学习，究竟有哪些益处呢？

4
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:25,925
Uni is often considered a logical step for people who wish to continue their education after school.
对于毕业后希望继续深造的人来说，上大学通常被视为顺理成章的一步。

5
00:00:25,925 --> 00:00:37,980
While options of Master’s degrees, PhDs and other postgraduate qualifications exist, many students leave after obtaining their Bachelor’s and head into the world of work.
虽然有硕士学位、博士学位以及其他研究生学历可供选择，但许多学生在获得学士学位后便踏入职场。

6
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:48,790
After years of doing the same job, some feel adding new skills or knowledge to their locker may open up new opportunities or help them to get a promotion.
在从事同一份工作多年后，有些人认为，掌握新的技能或知识能为自己开拓新的机遇，或是助力自己获得晋升。

7
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:55,300
Studying part-time in the evenings and weekends can be a great way to juggle responsibilities.
利用晚间和周末的时间攻读非全日制课程，是兼顾各项责任的好办法。

8
00:00:55,300 --> 00:01:06,840
In terms of the benefits, learning new techniques that you can bring into the workplace can make you more of an authority in your area and a go-to person for advice.
就收益而言，学习可应用于职场的新技术，能让你在所属领域更具权威性，成为他人咨询求助的对象。

9
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:13,300
If the business has a skills shortage, you may be able to step up to the plate and fill that gap.
如果公司存在技能缺口，你或许能挺身而出，填补这一空白。

10
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:20,310
In short, studying more could make you more promotable down the line and more useful to the business.
简而言之，深造学习能提升你未来的晋升潜力，也能让你对公司更有价值。

11
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:30,850
If you study in a classroom, your experience of the workplace could bring a wealth of knowledge to other students and provide real-life examples for you to draw on.
若选择课堂学习，你的职场经验既能为其他同学带来丰富的知识，也能为你自己的学习提供真实案例参考。

12
00:01:30,850 --> 00:01:37,380
You may also meet like-minded people who you can add to your professional network in the future.
你还有可能结识志同道合的人，将他们纳入你未来的职业人脉网络。

13
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:49,080
And while adult learners have to consider things like children, homelives and work, many adult and part-time courses are more flexible and spread over a number of years.
虽然成年学习者需要顾及子女、家庭生活和工作等诸多事宜，但许多成人及非全日制课程的灵活性更高，学制也会延长至数年。

14
00:01:49,080 --> 00:02:00,520
Some courses can even be done partly or entirely online, which means that you can manage your time more easily studying from home and you don’t need to factor in travel time.
部分课程甚至可以部分或全部在线上完成，这意味着你可以居家学习，更轻松地安排时间，还无需考虑通勤耗时。

15
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:06,180
So, there are a variety of options for those who wish to return to studying.
由此可见，对于希望重返校园学习的人来说，选择十分多样。

16
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:11,920
And increasing your skills may open up new careers or opportunities in your professional life.
而提升自身技能，则可能为你的职业生涯开辟新的道路，带来更多机遇。
